ock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\n- Reproducible in 4.7 RC 1\n- Not reproducible in 4.7 beta3\n- Not reproducible in 4.6.2\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.7.rc1 - Windows 11 (build 26200) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Direct3D 12 (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.9649) - AMD Ryzen 7 9800X3D 8-Core Processor (16 threads) - 30.88 GiB memory - WASAPI (48000 Hz, Stereo/mono)\n\n### Issue description\n\nEvery time I've tried to add an AnimationTree to this very simple project, it crashes. Project attached, I happened to be making an MRP for another bug. Seems to be a pretty recent regression -- repro rate is 100% afaict in 4.7 RC1, but not seeing it at all in beta 3 or 4.6.2.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nAdd an AnimationPlayer with some animations (e.g. moving a sprite around), then try to add an AnimationTree.\n\nIn this project I'd added a simple script (for another bug report), then deleted it and the node I'd added of that script (and its script extension). Mentioning it just in case that's part of the repro\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\nJust try to add an AnimationTree in this project, it should crash (does for me every time)\n\n[simple-test.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/28796758/simple-test.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/user